OL,3,GNEWSAFormer newspaper HQ to be turned
OL,4,Ainto padel courts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former headquarters and printing
OL,7,Fworks of the Express and Star newspaper
OL,8,Fin Wolverhampton will be converted into
OL,9,Fpadel courts.
OL,11,FCity of Wolverhampton Council has
OL,12,Fapproved plans to turn the building on
OL,13,FTower Street into Wolves Padel Centre.
OL,15,FThe ground floor and former printing
OL,16,Froom of the city's historic Express and
OL,17,FStar offices, which staff left in 2023
OL,18,Fafter more than 140 years, would be
OL,19,Fconverted into three doubles courts and
OL,20,Ftwo singles courts.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
