OL,3,GNEWSAFormer newspaper HQ to be turned
OL,4,Ainto padel courts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the application submitted
OL,7,Fto the council, the newspaper's former
OL,8,Fmailroom would be converted into
OL,9,Fanother doubles court for the racquet
OL,10,Fsport that combines elements of tennis
OL,11,Fand squash.
